# Module

## Type: Resource (T is Structure)

**Purpose:** A fully loaded resource record with all declaration fields.

**Primitive:** Primitive: Record

**Shape:**

- `kind:` — The resource kind.
- `name:` — The resource name.
- `filename:` — The file where the resource is declared.
- `...` — All declaration fields from the resource record.

**Representation:**

```ts
type Resource<T extends Structure> = {
  kind: string;
  name: string;
  filename: string;
} & T;
```
